xt\", \"q\": \"During the 2012–13 influenza season, similar ILI patterns were observed\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The epidemic threshold is set at 1.645 standard deviations above the seasonal baseline.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The national and regional baselines are the mean percentage of visits for ILI during non-influenza weeks\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The seasonal baseline proportion of P&I deaths is projected using a robust regression procedure\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Incidence rates are calculated using CDC's National Center for Health Statistics population estimates\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}